 "remarks": "Fully renovated! Spacious and bright 3 bed, 2 bath unit with tons of natural light. Property features an open, living room, dining room and kitchen with stainless steel appliances and quartz counters. 3 large bedrooms with ample closet space. Great storage in pantry, closets, and storage spaces. Property highlights include large porch, gas heating, central air, washer and dryer in unit, and off street parking for 2 cars. Conveniently located just an 8 minute walk from train station, 2 minutes from Stamford Trolley, and 3 minute drive to I95. Not to be missed!",
